[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14460.469, "timestamp": "04:01:00", "text": "明白了，但是这个组织的副负责人是你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14463.87, "timestamp": "04:01:03", "text": "他们派我去执行另一项任务，从而发现了真相和弱点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14473.03, "timestamp": "04:01:13", "text": "顺便说一句，为了继续履行组织领导的重要职责。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14475.67, "timestamp": "04:01:15", "text": "到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14479.71, "timestamp": "04:01:19", "text": "这次会议没有必要。我去了弗洛巴家。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14481.83, "timestamp": "04:01:21", "text": "它要来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14485.269, "timestamp": "04:01:25", "text": "我们就先说到这儿吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14497.91, "timestamp": "04:01:37", "text": "没必要。"}]